  "note": "Meta/Instagram Reels ad. Narration follows the owner's own ad infographics (data -> AI analysis -> signal -> see the setup -> Manual/Assist/Auto -> funds safe). VISUALS are the real captured app plates, never the infographic mockups: those carry invented prices (BTC 27,432.80, TP 29,200) and an invented '87% confidence', both of which COMPLIANCE.md bans and the engine's own hard limit forbids fabricating. Opening plate is composed by pipeline/make_cover.py -- the raw stills crop Lia's head to the top edge, so type had nowhere to go but her face.",
